          "VAT? Marcy can ignore it for US sales, since there's none to take out. In the UK and Europe, Amazon pulls VAT off first and then applies your rate.",
          "The delivery cost is the part people forget. It only touches the 70% option. On Amazon.com it's $0.15 per megabyte of your converted file, rounded up to the nearest kilobyte, with a $0.01 minimum. Marcy's guide is plain text. Tiny file. Tiny fee."
