          "Here's the bit that trips people up. Nothing flips on its own. If you've got a book parked on 35% at a price somewhere between $9.99 and $12.99, you have to go into your KDP Bookshelf and change the royalty option yourself. We've had clients sit on the old setting for weeks without noticing."
