          "At $2.99, the 70% option pays $1.88 a copy and 35% pays $1.05. At $4.99 it's $3.28 against $1.75. At $9.99, $6.78 against $3.50. At $12.99, $8.88 against $4.55. Now push one dollar past the cap to $13.99. Only 35% is available there, so Marcy would earn $4.90 a copy.",
          "That one extra dollar cuts what she earns per copy by about 45%. So if she's tempted to go higher, $12.99 is the price we'd tell her to test first.",
