          "If your book is image heavy, shrink the images before conversion and then compare both options on the pricing step. The pricing tab doubles as a royalty calculator and shows the estimated royalty for each option at whatever price you type in. We cover keeping image files lean in our guide on [how to format an ebook for Amazon KDP](/blog/how-to-format-an-ebook-for-amazon-kdp)."
