          "Round two is the copyedit or line edit, so sentences, focus and consistency, usually 2 to 3 weeks on a standard manuscript. Round three is the proofread on the formatted files, roughly a week. If you're not sure which ones your draft needs, [developmental editing vs copyediting](/blog/developmental-editing-vs-copyediting) sorts that out, and our service page is [ebook editing services](/ebook-editing-services)."
